### API 2 — File Management Server retrieval (GetEDMSFileQuery, Base64 PDF)
POST {{host}}/api/artifact-retrieval
Content-Type: application/json

{ "where": { "edmsFileId": "9eb84ea3-37c0-46a1-a75b-b8935c0c63bc", "moduleName": "Provider Enrollment" } }

### Stored verification result
GET {{host}}/api/verification-results/5fe4dcb2-0553-4f8b-b5bb-6fe5683fdf4e
Accept: application/json
